    ("PARTIAL", 1255, "src/engine/registerKinds.json covenant · src/engine/forward.ts earlyWarnings · src/pages/Loan360.tsx", "Built: a Loan Covenant register item with the covenant, its threshold as text and the next test date; a warning is shown as the test date approaches; covenants are also noted on the loan. Nothing declares a breach. Not built: measurement of the covenant against its threshold, and therefore the warning that the threshold is being approached."),
