    ("IMPLEMENTED", 1292, "src/pages/Forward.tsx · src/engine/forward.ts buildEvents · tests/forward.test.ts 'every event names its source, its certainty and how it was arrived at'", "Forward lists every recorded outflow in one table that can be filtered by source and certainty: contracts, tax deadlines and project work orders (registers), purchase orders, payroll and loan instalments; the payment priority view lists those due within 60 days. There is no screen titled 'We have promised this', renewals appear as warnings, and nothing can be acted on from the list. The test covers how the list is built, not an inbox."),
