    ("PARTIAL", 1352, "src/engine/ops.ts peopleCost · src/pages/PeopleCost.tsx · tests/sql/phase2_payroll.sql T114", "Built: workforce cost by department over the companies selected, and in total. Not built: by company as a table, by office (the office on the employee record is not used) and by project."),
    ("PARTIAL", 1355, "tests/forward.test.ts 'every event names its source, its certainty and how it was arrived at' · tests/numiOps.test.ts 'firm and uncertain amounts are never added into one unlabelled figure', 'names a source the person holds no permission for, even when the database is silent' · tests/forward.test.ts 'records that carry no exchange rate say which currency they are in' · src/lib/forwardData.ts · src/pages/Forward.tsx", "Built: Forward and NUMI work over every company selected, including the whole group, name each company on each event, and name the sources a person may not read in some companies (tested on the sample group); an event from a record that carries no exchange rate names its currency, and Forward states how many items it counts at face value, and in which currencies. Not built: conversion into one group currency (each amount is in the base currency of its company, and register items, loans, deposits, claims and advances in another currency are added without conversion); elimination of payments between group companies."),
